  "title": "Your Backlog Is Lying: Enforce It with PR Checks",
  "description": "If your backlog isn’t consistent, your metrics and plans aren’t either. In this session, we’ll explore how to enforce backlog integrity using Pull Request checks in Azure Repos and GitHub. See how to validate work items, enforce structure, and block merges when standards aren’t met—embedding governance directly into your SDLC without slowing developers down.\n\nSeating for this session is first-come, first-served. Add it to your schedule to plan your day and arrive early to secure a spot.",
